          "visual": "A white background features three floating 3D icons. One is a black and white circular geometric logo, another is a blue cloud-like shape with a white underscore and angle bracket, and the third is a blue-to-teal gradient infinity loop. The icons are spinning and converging toward the center with a slight bouncing motion. The lighting is uniform and bright across the entire frame, casting no significant shadows.",
