          "visual": "A semi-transparent blue circular pulse emanates from the right-most blue infinity logo, expanding slightly outward and then retracting. Another dark grey pill-shaped graphic slides down from the top center towards the logos. The lighting remains flat and bright, focusing entirely on the graphical elements.",
